  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Fig. 9, 'Workflow E: client reminder business process'. Two lanes: electronic immunization registry, and vaccination location health worker. From Start the health worker does 1. define/evaluate criteria and 2. select notification method; the registry does 3. generate list of clients and 4. send notifications. Then 5. client shows up for vaccination? Yes leads to D. administer vaccine; no leads to 6. is another reminder needed? Yes loops back to step 1; no leads to F. defaulter tracing.",
